>
>

pe'ibu'o {kutca} should be rejected, because the 4-letter-rafsi would be=20
similar to that of {gutci}.

The precise definition of {kutmi} would be:

x1 tarmi gi'e jalge lo nu lo terkubli be x2 bei x3 cu tcena ji'e lo nu tyky=
=20
simxu lo ka kruca kei kei kei gi'e to'e cimni

Note 1:=20
Temporal lojban definition of {kubli} by la xorxes on jbovlaste refers to=
=20
only hexahedron, so if we adopt it as official, we will need another word=
=20
for polytopes.
Note 2:=20
{to'e cimni} in the definition is for excluding hemipolyhedra. If you don't=
=20
mind including it, we may delete that part of the definition.


With {kutmi}, we will be able to create what la piier wants. For example,

starfish: kutmyfi'e: x1 finpe x2 gi'e se tarmi lo kutmi

star-nosed mole: kutmynazdermabru: x1 mabru x2 gi'e xabju lo dertu .ije lo=
=20
nazbi be x1 cu se tarmi lo kutmi=20

stellated polyhedron: cibykutmi: x1 kutmi li ci x2


mu'o

